		(at 34.61 5.42)
		(descr "Harwin M20-9980546 2x5 pin header, 2.54 mm pitch. Pads 7 and 8 (row 4, the key row) are left out: those two pins are pulled from the header before it is soldered, so a header whose key pins were not removed will not seat. Holes 1.02, pads 1.75 per the 5x8 connector spec. Pin numbers as the header: odd = left column, even = right column.")
